eist, Ghosts ARE souls.</div> </div> </div> </div>According to mage, 1/5th of the characters of which can <i>see</i> souls, they aren't.<br /> <br /> Sin-Eaters calling ghosts &quot;souls&quot; is like other people calling them &quot;spirits of the dead&quot;. They aren't spirits, either.<br /> <br /> Consequence of poetic language meeting specific jargon that uses the same words. Ghosts not being souls (and you might note, the effects of being a ghost or entering the Underworld on someone's Virtue and Vice are <i>exactly</i> the same as soul loss) doesn't make them not people, or make their emotional pain irrelevant. Spirits, Demons, and Prometheans don't have souls either, and no one thinks they're not worthy of respect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T05:14:11-07:00","id":115797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/42904-what-are-the-options-for-mages-not-dying-of-old-age?p=115050#post115050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(and you might note, the effects of being a ghost or entering the Underworld on someone's Virtue and Vice are <i>exactly</i> the same as soul loss).</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't understand this. What does this mean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T07:21:09-07:00","id":115835,"title":"","content":"That the Realm itself is draining souls and/or is empty with souls, duh. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> So <b>DaveB</b> is sugesting that all in Underworld ghosts <b>are not</b> true souls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-19-2014, 10:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T13:54:28-07:00","id":116077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/42904-what-are-the-options-for-mages-not-dying-of-old-age?p=115797#post115797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Vie